00:24:56,250 --> 00:25:02,250
In this drama from director Alan Parker, on-the-lam Jack McGurn flees to Los Angeles and takes
a job as a projectionist at a movie theater owned by a Japanese-American man.

4
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:21,000
Jack falls for the owner's daughter, Lily, but they are forced to elope
to Seattle when her father forbids the relationship.

5
00:41:33,750 --> 00:41:39,750
The couple marry and have a daughter, but when World War II breaks out,
Jack is powerless to stop his new family's forced internment.

